  "_comment": "OSCAR example: schema.org Dataset for NEMAR dataset nm000103, current as of 2026-09-03. Server-render this inside a <script type=\"application/ld+json\"> tag in the dataset page head so a plain HTTP request returns it; nemar.org already emits markup of this kind. Keep the page's rel=canonical on its own URL and link any upstream record with sameAs, never with canonical. Remove this _comment field before shipping.",
