      "contentSize": "270 GB",
      "description": "Browsable BIDS tree; large files are git-annex blobs on Amazon S3. Install the command-line tool with `bun add -g nemar-cli` or `npm install -g nemar-cli`. Download the whole dataset with `nemar dataset download nm000103`, fetch selected files with `nemar dataset clone nm000103` then `nemar dataset get <files>`, or fetch individual small files over HTTP."
    },
    {
      "@type": "DataDownload",
      "name": "Zarr serving copy",
      "contentUrl": "https://zarr.nemar.org/nm000103/zarr/index.json",
      "encodingFormat": "application/json",
      "description": "Derived, latest-only Zarr copy for reading a slice of a recording without downloading the dataset. index.json is the mandatory entry point: read contract_base, data_base, and s3_uri from it rather than hardcoding a bucket path. Stream for a slice; download the BIDS tree when you will touch most of the array."
    }
